                <custos xml:id="m-03806c06-d0b0-4cde-8860-410d2a93121c" facs="#m-c3e3234d-c9d9-4767-a208-dcae6814e286" pname="f" oct="3" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-a6a3319a-cdea-42c3-b194-4e7a1abc7a69">
              <lg xml:id="m-34f04ccd-52f1-425e-9c98-8188b60815ce">
                <l xml:id="m-a199f3d6-7e88-4c84-8ee7-e5900ccb7dc9" facs="#m-59003a71-2c81-4219-afd5-c1bdafda7af7" label="ambiguous">820</l><l xml:id="m-d3ce536f-73c3-46f9-95d1-202bb2b7c358" facs="#m-0e229687-cf77-41ac-a875-1737e66a4e25" label="text-like">Saturday betore the 3rd Sunday after Easter.</l><l xml:id="m-b1b5331a-8847-4130-aea8-983be6d11559" facs="#m-75ec123f-e14d-499b-acd4-b55b261ce5d1" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-30fb46c0-616f-411f-a7d1-5454217ccbc8" facs="#m-e3085e29-6511-4e4a-a70e-898291c65f2c" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-dbebbba1-7da3-43cf-83c3-5a1bd0b2c7ed" facs="#m-34d05b88-cca4-47f1-9a45-68fcc2846e34" label="ambiguous">r. Petr. 2. d.</l><l xml:id="m-b63136c4-6e71-4fca-8147-47ea88be22d9" facs="#m-cc7a6ecf-0223-48d1-bc83-5af91ad9a5d8" label="lyrics-like">(Rátis enim sicut oves errántes, f] stórem, 4 et epíscopum animárum</l><l xml:id="m-8b6641c6-28ad-4477-b2ea-e63a8d0bff45" facs="#m-26f71253-ca2d-40d2-95bf-cfb8b6d105e5" label="lyrics-like">Used convérsi estis nunc ad pa-l vestrárum.</l><l xml:id="m-782c50ba-f858-44e8-a674-d06b5cd8b08b" facs="#m-c7e7c763-321b-4f41-ab2f-c4ddcda5fa90" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Gavisi sunt discípuli. D. 249.</l><l xml:id="m-0c7d167e-c250-49fb-b68a-2448e6cfd2c3" facs="#m-182e76dc-b0d7-4184-979b-f6f4841b4db7" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-e3b775f3-6ce3-4dec-9a70-9759dbc9c8d4" facs="#m-1e8a1c7d-d0f0-4ac1-8351-4baa2b87803d" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Allelúia. Psalms of the Sunday, p. 251.</l><l xml:id="m-503c4366-fd2a-401a-ac48-21ba55b9e2b1" facs="#m-d88f11bd-1685-41b1-9d79-56ab4af754da" label="ambiguous">r. Petr. 2. d.</l><l xml:id="m-2b6213cf-0e16-4a6f-91df-519bb0e7d935" facs="#m-787e24a0-0d36-46a6-afe6-a48e45b8460b" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-8a366bcf-dd40-41fb-8f23-a31b9cc56455" facs="#m-11549f16-bb05-4372-8059-2fcb2b775e0d" label="lyrics-like">vArissimi: Christus passus est ejus."Qui peccátum non fecit, nec</l><l xml:id="m-29d49304-5070-4a66-b40b-ea9a1c81719d" facs="#m-02c0734e-cb3c-4f02-8459-14133aa3b959" label="ambiguous">A pro nobis, t vobis relinquens</l><l xml:id="m-01feac81-1d08-4840-be67-3319e4877f53" facs="#m-fe9321e9-b7d6-4768-b9e5-1db232d5bed2" label="lyrics-like">invéntus est dolus in ore ejus.</l><l xml:id="m-f32f8ffc-d690-4c4c-b9b2-1453e26edf27" facs="#m-cd5d40d5-19cf-486b-8c60-16cfbf3d6557" label="lyrics-like">exémplum, ut sequámini vestígia</l><l xml:id="m-4fc63daa-bb58-4916-8a9c-2e6ffe520a09" facs="#m-3a438ef7-cd91-4648-b596-a4f03553a591" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. Ad régias Agni dápes. D. 812 or 814. V. Máne nobiscum. p. 815.</l><l xml:id="m-24d209b4-3ca1-4014-9529-8cda91bd8435" facs="#m-7a683ddf-c7b1-4321-837b-a0b2af03b997" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-a115badb-3443-472f-9ea4-f802495b8864" facs="#m-369fee3a-afb3-4eaa-bc2b-8ff611e79bbd" label="ambiguous">Ant. 3. a</l><l xml:id="m-bb2ded6a-438b-471b-a5f2-3539b25fa805" facs="#m-c815985a-8077-4101-aa31-319d1b095212" label="lyrics-like">pástor bó-nus, qui pásco óves</l><l xml:id="m-5c2e5549-7cfc-40ac-bb25-3d450b65ddf9" facs="#m-67aa6fed-ccf4-419f-9f5e-272f9e35f5fa" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-bc9b67c0-6731-485c-888e-a5fb06d9b3ba" facs="#m-1ed61c64-f601-4a0e-af49-23640fe3ddc2" label="ambiguous">-go sum</l><l xml:id="m-08530241-538e-4309-87fc-3c990f0ae770" facs="#m-3c8d5766-8b9d-4fd4-afec-9dd7b0ce2dcc" label="lyrics-like">mé¬ as, et pro óvibus mé- is póno ánimam mé-am,</l><l xml:id="m-6a4af86d-e79b-4c94-b97e-cbec996a970f" facs="#m-eeb32519-8617-48c7-8b3f-daaae6149611" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú-ia. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-c9f90c0b-ad54-4b5d-acc1-34474b80b775" facs="#m-0987dc59-0084-439b-ad47-22135a31873e" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 3. a. p. 208. — Prayer. Deus, qui in Filii. p. 817.</l><l xml:id="m-68ce1fc3-8418-4ae7-a800-4ea33575141f" facs="#m-5e351887-bec5-4d86-b568-f31f5fe4f547" label="text-like">The Commemoration of the Cross is then said, p. 261.</l><l xml:id="m-c7ad9096-6bb7-4683-89f8-dea9f40cabf6" facs="#m-25c92247-b1d2-46af-aa07-518650b4c50a" label="text-like">Saturday before the third Sunday after Easter.</l><l xml:id="m-5ef684f3-252f-4247-9051-ed63aa358ecd" facs="#m-612c8de7-8700-4fc5-93e7-1fcf9932b1e1" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-a71b25da-28b9-4f34-b179-d2c2ef76f911" facs="#m-3c00507a-4bed-4e44-a279-cd588219ee4f" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Allelúia. Psalms of Saturday, p. 307.</l><l xml:id="m-f7d63e8c-9b3a-405f-9be8-112fb0b4eb6f" facs="#m-3a7d6893-86a0-4624-a75b-7bcb433bf1d8" label="lyrics-like">Chapter. Carissimi : Obsecro vos. p. 824. Hymn. Ad régias Agni- p. 812</l><l xml:id="m-6f308710-22c3-4f35-b5b3-46a02269a5ea" facs="#m-3c446016-aa18-490e-84f6-9f5e66264a51" label="lyrics-like">or p. 814. V. Máne nobiscum. D. 818.</l><l xml:id="m-341acb56-8613-4341-8d12-cda2533ac268" facs="#m-eba24bfd-53a5-4502-8ea1-8b357e548e9e" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-bc820294-c917-4bed-a376-451f5ed606aa" facs="#m-1b777632-546e-41aa-a458-7d840ecb51da" label="ambiguous">Ant. G. F</l><l xml:id="m-f959a234-49e2-4570-9e82-447496c23d1c" facs="#m-758d5a69-3192-4b53-a3ea-afe9b7e04b0e" label="lyrics-like">Odicum, “ et non vidébi-tis me, dí cit Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-ced356cc-5671-4a15-ab43-effdc400ad4a" facs="#m-7357e0d5-3118-47f8-9004-3e588af53145" label="lyrics-like">nus: i-terum mó-di- cum, et vidébi-tis me: qui-a vádo</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>